/119124.patch","merged_at":"2026-05-04T17:46:51Z"},"body":"Contributes to https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/43440\r\n\r\nAdds unit tests for `NinePatchRect` covering its full public API surface:\r\n\r\n- Default property values (texture, patch margins, region rect, draw center, axis stretch modes, mouse filter, minimum size)\r\n- `set_texture` / `get_texture` round-trip, including clearing the texture\r\n- `texture_changed` signal emission: new texture, same texture (no re-emit), replacement, and clearing\r\n- `set_patch_margin` / `get_patch_margin` for all four sides independently and in isolation\r\n- Patch margins driving `get_combined_minimum_size()` (left + right, top + bottom)\r\n- Out-of-range `Side` index guarded by `ERR_FAIL_INDEX`\r\n- `region_rect` round-trip and `draw_center` toggling\r\n- All three `AxisStretchMode` values for both axes, and independence between the two axes\r\n\r\nAI disclosure: I designed the test plan, wrote every line, and ran pre-commit and the test suite locally. Claude Sonnet 4.6 helped with initial research and drafting.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public",